    },
    "g4s": {
      "say": "Then bring us a better way, and the Collective will listen — we are engineers, not zealots. The Plutocracy, however... they want more than daylight. Ask them what their new sun ORBITS.",
      "to": "gr1"
    },
    "g1": {
      "say": "State your business or be recycled. ...Ah. The investigator. The Collective has expected this conversation for some time.",
